--
A constructor body is instantiated while only the constructor's constraints
are checked (N5008 [temp.inst]/11).  Reduced from the libc++ tuple chain in
which is_convertible<const tuple<at, tuple<int>> &, tuple<int>> instantiates
a tuple<int> constructor that clang does not.
